text: >-
  Sam Parker

  @BasedSamParker • 11m

  5 ...

  BREAKING: Mikey McCoy shows up in Google searches from Cayman

  Islands IP addresses the day before the assassination--September 9th.

  However, Charlie Kirk himself is absent from Cayman Islands searches.

  Many others of our cast of characters also show up: Deirdre Amaro, George

  Hodgson Zinn, Hunter Kozak, Tyler Robinson, etc. (Remember how Zinn

  was telling people he was paid?) But that's not even the half of

  it...photographers, videographers, security, legal team, Brilyn Hollyhand,

  and more all show up in searches from the Cayman Islands! WATCH.

  Cayman Islands: The Cayman Islands are notorious for involvement in

  offshore bank accounts for politicians, businessmen, drug cartels, etc. It's

  known for its use in money laundering, tax sheltering, and criminal payoffs,

  etc. Look into it.

  VPN?: Many of these people also show up in unique DC & israel IP searches

  as well. I think this debunks the "What if these searches used a VPN?"

  question. Did someone decide they were going to search for these people

  from DC, israel and Cayman Islands IP addresses using their VPN? Or were

  these actual searches from the actual places? I feel like the more likely

  explanation at this point is that these are searches from these actual

  places.

  DISCLAIMER: I don't know what these results mean. I don't ascribe guilt to

  anyone. I'm not alledging anything nefarious. I'm simply presenting data.

  Please don't go attack anyone and say "Sam Parker said these people are

  guilty!" More research will need to be done to figure what this all means, if
  it

  means anything at all. For now, it's another set of data points to consider.

  = Google Trends Home Explore Trending Now

  • 'samuel Parker"

  • 'charlie kirk

  Search term

  3/1/25 - 9/9/25 -

  • "brian hollyhand"

  Sesrch lemm

  • "hollyhand"

